# .robignore
# Patterns for scripts or parent containers to ignore during extraction.
# Syntax follows .gitignore conventions:
#
# - Comments start with '#'
# - Ignore all scripts under a parent or ancestor folder:
#   Cmdr
#   Chat
#
# - Ignore a specific hierarchical path:
#   StarterGui/Inventory
#
# - Ignore by script name or glob pattern:
#   *.spec
#   TestScript
#
# - Negation with '!' to re-include specific scripts:
#   !Cmdr/Shared/Util
